[03/22 10:42:46     12s] @@file 13: set_db design_process_node $iv::node
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] ##  Process: 65            (User Set)               
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] ##     Node: (not set)                           
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] ##  Check design process and node:  
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] ##  Design tech node is not set.
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 65nm process node: total_c_th=0, relative_c_th=1 and coupling_c_th=0.1.
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 	Capacitance filtering mode(extract_rc_cap_filter_mode option of the set_db) is 'relative_and_coupling' for all engines.
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 	The accuracy mode for post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction will be set to 'high'.
[03/22 10:42:46     12s] 	Default value for EffortLevel(extract_rc_effort_level option of the set_db) in post_route extraction mode will be 'medium' if Quantus QRC technology file is specified else 'low'.
